-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Base model
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The WaterSheep model is fine-tuned from ModernBERT-base by Answer.AI and
LightOn (https://huggingface.co/answerdotai/ModernBERT-base), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. The encoder weights were modified by
fine-tuning, and a decision head was added.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Synthetic training data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Synthetic training examples, label descriptions and soft labels were produced
with Qwen3.5-4B by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud
(https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

